widget trustpilot-widget trustpilot-slice" data-locale="en-GB" data-template-id="53aa8912dec7e10d38f59f36" data-businessunit-id="620fbe077a2b86af5e54e1a2" data-style-height="140px" data-style-width="100%" data-theme="light" data-stars="4,5" data-review-languages="en" data-font-family="Poppins" data-v-03e10e28><a href="https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/www.evri.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-03e10e28> Trustpilot </a></div></div><span id="skip-reviews" data-v-03e10e28></span></section><section id="what-to-sell-on-ebay" class="section-wrapper" index="9" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><div class="section__description" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6o145bqstJ9-cZG_EVRI_LOCATION_06_111488a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6o145bqstJ9-cZG_EVRI_LOCATION_06_11148.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6o145bqstJ9-cZG_EVRI_LOCATION_06_11148.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6o145bqstJ9-cZG_EVRI_LOCATION_06_11148.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An older woman sits on a brown sofa. A cup of tea is resting of the arm. She is using an Ipad tablet to order a parcel on the Evri website." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--h-100 card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>What to sell on eBay</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->On eBay UK, both new and second-hand items are popular. Electronics, fashion, home and garden goods, and collectables are in high demand. Whether you&#39;re clearing out your home, helping a relative move, or creating your own products, eBay is a great platform to sell on. Buyers use eBay for its wide variety of products and competitive prices, while sellers benefit from eBay&#39;s large customer base, user-friendly platform, and low fees. If you’re new to selling on eBay, you can access different markets by listing your unwanted items, second-hand goods, handmade products, and more.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 