tps://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer carrying multiple parcels inside a ParcelShop store, ready to drop off for delivery" width="1000" height="667" class="landing-feature-banner__image landing-feature-banner__image--image-right" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--image-right landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>eBay Seller hub</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Discover our hub for eBay sellers. Whether you&#39;re starting an eBay business or you’re a more experienced seller, our guides and resources will suit your needs. Explore our content to make shipping easy and boost your sales using Evri and eBay! Find guides on shipping, packaging, linking your Evri account, and tips on what to sell and how to grow your business.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__button-wrapper" data-v-54256dfc><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link landing-feature-banner__button landing-feature-banner__button--standard" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/ebay-seller-hub" data-v-54256dfc style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Learn more<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></main></div></div><div id="teleports"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUX