ng":16,"slug":17,"first_publication_date":18,"last_publication_date":18,"uid":17,"link_type":19,"key":20,"isBroken":21},"ZL-1EREAACAAEkhR","subpath1",[15],"Guides","en-gb","guides","2023-07-25T12:59:36+0000","Document","ae1cdca3-7951-4e98-bb07-7c8775dcd737",false,{"link_type":19},[24,43,72,118,246,276,351,370,403,416,438,634,662,684,698],{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":27,"primary":29,"id":41,"slice_type":42,"slice_label":30},"pageHeaderNoCta","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[28],{},{"theme":30,"PageHeaderTitle":31,"PageHeaderText":32,"PageHeaderImage":38,"heroImage":39,"videoContent":40,"showPremiumLogo":30},null,"How to sell on eBay",[33],{"type":34,"text":35,"spans":36,"direction":37},"paragraph","A simple guide to start selling on eBay",[],"ltr",{},{},{"link_type":19},"page_header$685be352-9a1d-4aca-9374-66032117e119","page_header",{"variation":44,"version":26,"items":45,"primary":47,"id":70,"slice_type":71,"slice_label":30},"default-slice",[46],{},{"CardImage":48,"CardAvatar":59,"CardTitle":60,"CardText":61,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":68,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":49,"alt":52,"copyright":30,"url":53,"id":54,"edit":55},{"width":50,"height":51},1000,667,"A mother is placing the lid on a parcel box with the shipping label attached so it is ready to send. Her two children are sat on the sofa behind her reading a book.","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zc65bqstJ9-inP_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7587.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zc65bqstJ9-inP",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},0,1,"transparent","none","eBay selling guide",[62,65],{"type":34,"text":63,"spans":64,"direction":37},"Selling on eBay is a great opportunity for UK-based sellers to reach millions of buyers worldwide. Our simple guide* to selling on eBay is here to help you every step of the way. Learn how to create an account, list your items quickly, and pick the right carrier for delivering your goods from your laptop. We even share top tips on the best-selling items on eBay to make it easy for you to choose. Read on to find out how to become a successful eBay seller.",[],{"type":34,"text":66,"spans":67,"direction":37},"*Content for this guide is accurate as of March 2025.",[],{"link_type":69},"Any","card$190bc9f4-7c73-4e91-ae59-d827179c3e89","card",{"variation":73,"version":26,"items":74,"primary":112,"id":116,"slice_type":117,"slice_label":30},"listNoIcon",[75,82,88,94,100,106],{"title":76,"content":77,"isNumbered":81},"Login or create an eBay account",[78],{"type":34,"text":79,"spans":80,"direction":37},"Select ‘Sell’ from the top menu of the web page ",[],true,{"title":83,"content":84,"isNumbered":81},"Add a title for your first item",[85],{"type":34,"text":86,"spans":87,"direction":37},"You can start typing keywords to describe the product using the search bar and eBay will suggest relevant options. If there is an existing listing that matches your item, you can select this option to pre-fill your listing and save time from adding the details manually. If not, you can choose to ‘continue without match’",[],{"title":89,"content":90,"isNumbered":81},"Confirm the condition of your item",[91],{"type":34,"text":92,"spans":93,"direction":37},"eBay will provide different options for you to choose from",[],{"title":95,"content":96,"isNumbered":81},"Add more details about your listing",[97],{"type":34,"text":98,"spans":99,"direction":37},"Complete any empty fields for your listing and make sure all the information is correct. This includes the title, specific details to help customers filter by preference, the description, uploading photos, and more. Don’t worry, eBay’s smart features will help you write a description and make recommendations about prices",[],{"title":101,"content":102,"isNumbered":81},"Select your delivery and listing preferences",[103],{"type":34,"text":104,"spans":105,"direction":37},"Make sure to check out our section below for guidance on choosing a delivery provider and how to change your preferences",[],{"title":107,"content":108,"isNumbered":81},"Ready to list your item?",[109],{"type":34,"text":110,"spans":111,"direction":37},"If you’re ready to list straight away, select ‘Preview’ to check you’re happy before confirming your listing. You can also ‘save for later’ and return to your draft listing when it’s convenient",[],{"theme":113,"title":114,"description":115,"showPaddingTop":21},"standard","How to start selling on eBay","Whether you’re a frequent eBay buyer or your first time using the platform, setting up an eBay shop couldn’t be more straightforward! eBay has introduced plenty of great features to help make your listing an easy and fast process. Don’t forget to add your payment details, so customers can send money for your items. Here are our step-by-step instructions using your desktop browser to help you get started:","list_block$94ea643d-7494-4a1e-986a-9ed25b57f891","list_block",{"variation":119,"version":26,"items":120,"primary":242,"id":245,"slice_type":117,"slice_label":30},"listComponent",[121,134,146,158,170,182,194,206,218,230],{"title":122,"content":123,"icon":127},"Clear titles",[124],{"type":34,"text":125,"spans":126,"direction":37},"Use relevant keywords in your title to help buyers find your listing. Be specific about the product and its main features.",[],{"dimensions":128,"alt":130,"copyright":30,"url":131,"id":132,"edit":133},{"width":129,"height":129},40,"Lightbulb icon","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9028d913-9c89-4f01-b423-3fd1d160c4a1_lightbulb.svg?auto=compress,format","Yh96FRIAACoA-Zru",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},{"title":135,"content":136,"icon":140},"Great photos",[137],{"type":34,"text":138,"spans":139,"direction":37},"Take clear, bright photos from different angles. Show any unique features or flaws to build trust with buyers.",[],{"dimensions":141,"alt":142,"copyright":30,"url":143,"id":144,"edit":145},{"width":129,"height":129},"Camera icon","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9ecd696f-d8c8-4a09-bdab-f2ed97d94895_cameras.svg","Yh96GBIAACkA-Zso",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},{"title":147,"content":148,"icon":152},"Detailed descriptions",[149],{"type":34,"text":150,"spans":151,"direction":37},"Give a thorough product description, including the condition, size, colour, brand, and any other important details. Be honest and accurate.",[],{"dimensions":153,"alt":154,"copyright":30,"url":155,"id":156,"edit":157},{"width":129,"height":129},"Followed instructions icon","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0b60c675-436d-4ca1-8857-2bfbff3cb847_followed_instructions.svg","YflB_BEAACIA8pcK",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},{"title":159,"content":160,"icon":164},"Optimised listings",[161],{"type":34,"text":162,"spans":163,"direction":37},"Use eBay’s item specifics and categories to make your listing searchable. Fill in as many details as you can.",[],{"dimensions":165,"alt":166,"copyright":30,"url":167,"id":168,"edit":169},{"width":129,"height":129},"Laptop icon","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},{"title":171,"content":172,"icon":176},"Competitive prices",[173],{"type":34,"text":174,"spans":175,"direction":37},"Check similar items to price yours competitively and use eBay's pricing tools to help choose the best price point.",[],{"dimensions":177,"alt":178,"copyright":30,"url":179,"id":180,"edit":181},{"width":129,"height":129},"Pricing icon","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0d6596ea-88df-43fd-b67a-22e944657aa2_pricing.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-Zrx",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},{"title":183,"content":184,"icon":188},"Free shipping",[185],{"type":34,"text":186,"spans":187,"direction":37},"Offer free shipping if you can. It attracts more buyers.",[],{"dimensions":189,"alt":190,"copyright":30,"url":191,"id":192,"edit":193},{"width":129,"height":129},"Icon of a lorry turning left","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F368d77c0-145d-4481-a619-4399e853d1cb_lorry+-+facing+left.svg","Yh96FhIAAC8A-Zr6",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},{"title":195,"content":196,"icon":200},"Easy returns",[197],{"type":34,"text":198,"spans":199,"direction":37},"Provide a clear returns policy. This reassures buyers and boosts their confidence.",[],{"dimensions":201,"alt":202,"copyright":30,"url":203,"id":204,"edit":205},{"width":129,"height":129},"Large parcel icon","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F97975357-8cb0-4e5c-8466-86156e50fd76_parcel2.svg","Yh96FRIAAC8A-Zrt",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},{"title":207,"content":208,"icon":212},"Good customer service",[209],{"type":34,"text":210,"spans":211,"direction":37},"Respond quickly to inquiries and be friendly. Good communication can lead to positive feedback and repeat customers.",[],{"dimensions":213,"alt":214,"copyright":30,"url":215,"id":216,"edit":217},{"width":129,"height":129},"Friendly icon","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9fb9d950-2c3e-4a43-a975-c773dd47adf3_friendly.svg","YflB_BEAACEA8pcM",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},{"title":219,"content":220,"icon":224},"Promotions and ads",[221],{"type":34,"text":222,"spans":223,"direction":37},"Use eBay’s promotional tools to offer discounts, increase your visibility as a seller, and attract more buyers.",[],{"dimensions":225,"alt":226,"copyright":30,"url":227,"id":228,"edit":229},{"width":129,"height":129},"Success icon","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},{"title":231,"content":232,"icon":236},"Keep listings updated",[233],{"type":34,"text":234,"spans":235,"direction":37},"Remove items that are no longer available to avoid disappointing potential buyers.",[],{"dimensions":237,"alt":238,"copyright":30,"url":239,"id":240,"edit":241},{"width":129,"height":129},"Calender icon","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd07cc46f-b0cc-4157-a458-56979ba382e7_calendar.svg","Yh96FxIAAC4A-Zsf",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},{"theme":113,"title":243,"description":244},"10 tips for selling on eBay","Increase your chances of success with our top tips for selling on eBay:","list_block$72f570c0-0760-4a76-9b25-748abb0fffd3",{"variation":44,"version":26,"items":247,"primary":249,"id":275,"slice_type":71,"slice_label":30},[248],{},{"CardImage":250,"CardAvatar":59,"CardTitle":256,"CardText":257,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":274,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":251,"alt":252,"copyright":30,"url":253,"id":254,"edit":255},{"width":50,"height":51},"A female courier dressed in an Evri uniform stands in front of a blue Evri van. She is posing with a parcel in her hands.","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_05bqstJ9-iMl_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9407.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6y_05bqstJ9-iMl",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},"Choosing your delivery provider",[258,261],{"type":34,"text":259,"spans":260,"direction":37},"It’s important to choose the right delivery provider to give your customers a positive experience from start to finish which will help you achieve a high eBay seller rating. Reliable, fast delivery builds trust and encourages repeat purchases. With Evri, you get an outstanding service for great value.",[],{"type":34,"text":262,"spans":263,"direction":37},"See what puts us among the best courier services in the UK for your business.",[264,272],{"start":265,"end":266,"type":267,"data":268},27,58,"hyperlink",{"link_type":269,"url":270,"target":271},"Web","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fbest-courier-services-in-the-uk","_blank",{"start":265,"end":266,"type":273},"strong",{"link_type":69},"card$7c607924-49de-4591-9f71-2fda538cb481",{"variation":277,"version":26,"items":278,"primary":344,"id":350,"slice_type":71,"slice_label":30},"multiContentCard",[279,298,328],{"CardImage":280,"CardTitle":286,"CardText":287},{"dimensions":281,"alt":282,"copyright":30,"url":283,"id":284,"edit":285},{"width":50,"height":51},"A customer is crouched on the floor of their apartment, placing a cardboard parcel inside waterproof packaging.","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XscpbqstJ9-We0_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5276.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6XscpbqstJ9-We0",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},"Package up your items",[288],{"type":34,"text":289,"spans":290,"direction":37},"Package and prepare your parcel ready for sending to your customer. See our guide on how to package your parcel for more information.",[291,297],{"start":292,"end":293,"type":267,"data":294},85,111,{"link_type":269,"url":295,"target":296},"how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-wrap-a-parcel","_self",{"start":292,"end":293,"type":273},{"CardImage":299,"CardTitle":305,"CardText":306},{"dimensions":300,"alt":301,"copyright":30,"url":302,"id":303,"edit":304},{"width":50,"height":51},"A close-up of a customer applying a label to their parcel. A ParcelShop Print in Store device is in view behind the parcel.","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJbpbqstJ9-TgK_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C6706%2C4473&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJbpbqstJ9-TgK",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},"Buy your label",[307],{"type":34,"text":308,"spans":309,"direction":37},"Go to Evri.com to purchase your label. Check out our guides on how to send a parcel and how to label a parcel to find out more.",[310,315,316,321,322,327],{"start":311,"end":312,"type":267,"data":313},6,14,{"link_type":269,"url":314,"target":271},"how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fevri.com",{"start":311,"end":312,"type":273},{"start":317,"end":318,"type":267,"data":319},63,83,{"link_type":269,"url":320,"target":271},"how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-send-a-parcel",{"start":317,"end":318,"type":273},{"start":323,"end":324,"type":267,"data":325},88,109,{"link_type":269,"url":326,"target":271},"how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-label-a-parcel",{"start":323,"end":324,"type":273},{"CardImage":329,"CardTitle":336,"CardText":337},{"dimensions":330,"alt":331,"copyright":30,"url":332,"id":333,"edit":334},{"width":50,"height":51},"Post Office ParcelShop","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F19e68f6f-ac0d-4bce-b8c7-db5227dbfa2f_Option+1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C474%2C8192%2C5464&w=1000&h=667","ZgKfWhAAACkAd80m",{"x":56,"y":335,"zoom":57,"background":58},474,"Send your parcel and update your listing",[338,341],{"type":34,"text":339,"spans":340,"direction":37},"Drop off your parcel at 10,000 ParcelShop and Locker locations near you or arrange a Courier collection from your home or work address.",[],{"type":34,"text":342,"spans":343,"direction":37},"You can update your eBay listing by going to 'my eBay'. Under your ‘selling’ section, you can select more actions for your sold items and add your tracking number. eBay will automatically notify your buyer that their item has been dispatched and they can track their item.",[],{"CardSectionTitle":345,"CardSectionText":346},"Shipping orders for eBay",[347],{"type":34,"text":348,"spans":349,"direction":37},"When listing a product to sell, your customers can choose which Vinted delivery partner they’d like to carry their items. Not all carrier options are convenient for sellers. At Evri, we have over 10,000+ drop-off locations for you to choose from and 93% of the UK population lives within 2 miles of a ParcelShop or Locker - so it’s likely we’d make a top choice for you. Our cheapest delivery service also means you can deliver your items to a ParcelShop for customers to collect when it suits them. Plus, you can even print your labels in-store for free to make it even easier for you.",[],"card$772915eb-e3a3-40ba-a8ae-620c86e76cf7",{"variation":44,"version":26,"items":352,"primary":353,"id":369,"slice_type":71,"slice_label":30},[],{"CardImage":354,"CardAvatar":59,"CardTitle":360,"CardText":361,"ButtonText":365,"ButtonUrl":366,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":355,"alt":356,"copyright":30,"url":357,"id":358,"edit":359},{"width":50,"height":51},"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office using their laptop to book multiple parcels","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},"eBay integrations",[362],{"type":34,"text":363,"spans":364,"direction":37},"You can also ship orders directly using Evri.com. Why not check out our easy tool to make sending eBay parcels even faster? You can book multiple orders at once when you connect your eBay account with Evri. Simply import your customer orders in one go and set your parcel defaults to make sending even faster in future.",[],"Find out more",{"link_type":269,"key":367,"url":368},"333ab116-d64e-4068-8e73-924cc4776e75","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Febay-integration","card$cb9d5d90-67ae-4b24-ab96-565af0836a59",{"variation":371,"version":26,"items":372,"primary":373,"id":402,"slice_type":71,"slice_label":30},"cardNoImageWithCta",[],{"CardAvatar":59,"CardTitle":374,"CardText":375,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":401,"IsEco":21},"How to change your eBay delivery preference to Evri",[376,379,383,386,389,392,395,398],{"type":34,"text":377,"spans":378,"direction":37},"When you’re listing a product to sell, eBay will likely apply a recommendation for its delivery. This is often based on how other sellers have sent similar items to yours. If you’d like to switch carriers, follow the steps below:",[],{"type":380,"text":381,"spans":382,"direction":37},"o-list-item","Go to ‘change’ on the right-hand side of the delivery section",[],{"type":380,"text":384,"spans":385,"direction":37},"Make sure you switch the toggle on for ‘post your item’",[],{"type":380,"text":387,"spans":388,"direction":37},"Select ‘change delivery service’",[],{"type":380,"text":390,"spans":391,"direction":37},"Choose the correct parcel size for your item",[],{"type":380,"text":393,"spans":394,"direction":37},"Scroll through the service until you find Evri",[],{"type":380,"text":396,"spans":397,"direction":37},"Select our Standard or Next Day delivery service",[],{"type":380,"text":399,"spans":400,"direction":37},"Complete your listing",[],{"link_type":69},"card$81ccbff8-4b79-44dd-96d9-5a424278b5d5",{"variation":44,"version":26,"items":404,"primary":405,"id":414,"slice_type":415,"slice_label":30},[],{"heading":406,"description":407,"image":408},"TRUSTED by our customers","We handle over 700 million parcels every year. Trusted by leading retail brands like Hello Fresh, John Lewis, Wayfair, Next and more - we've earned more 5-star Trustpilot ratings than any other UK carrier. Check out what our customers say about their experience below or see our Trustpilot reviews for more information.",{"dimensions":409,"alt":410,"copyright":30,"url":411,"id":412,"edit":413},{"width":50,"height":51},"A family of four pose smiling in front of their front door holding two parcels. The family consists of a father, mother and two daughters.","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7201.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},"trust_pilot$b838a6de-0b80-4df9-b542-9a105dc36909","trust_pilot",{"variation":417,"version":26,"items":418,"primary":419,"id":437,"slice_type":71,"slice_label":30},"cardWithinSection",[],{"CardSectionTitle":420,"CardSectionText":421,"CardImage":425,"CardTitle":431,"CardText":432,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":436,"IsEco":21},"",[422],{"type":34,"text":423,"spans":424,"direction":37}," ",[],{"dimensions":426,"alt":427,"copyright":30,"url":428,"id":429,"edit":430},{"width":50,"height":51},"An older woman sits on a brown sofa. A cup of tea is resting of the arm. She is using an Ipad tablet to order a parcel on the Evri website.","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6o145bqstJ9-cZG_EVRI_LOCATION_06_11148.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6o145bqstJ9-cZG",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":57,"background":58},"What to sell on eBay",[433],{"type":34,"text":434,"spans":435,"direction":37},"On eBay UK, both new and second-hand items are popular. Electronics, fashion, home and garden goods, and collectables are in high demand. Whether you're clearing out your home, helping a relative move, or creating your own products, eBay is a great platform to sell on. Buyers use eBay for its wide variety of products and competitive prices, while sellers benefit from eBay's large customer base, user-friendly platform, and low fees. If you’re new to selling on eBay, you can access different markets by listing your unwanted items, second-hand goods, handmade products, and more.",[],{"link_type":69},"card$eee054a9-6351-4c44-877e-4b3eea037c9d",{"variation":277,"version":26,"items":439,"primary":627,"id":633,"slice_type":71,"slice_label":30},[440,465,483,507,525,543,561,579,606],{"CardImage":441,"CardTitle":447,"CardText":448},{"dimensions":442,"alt":443,"copyright":30,"url":444,"id":445,"edit":446},{"width":50,"height":51},"A close-up of a customer sitting on a sofa, holding their phone and smiling at their screen.","how-to-sell-on-ebay.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prism